# CO-308: winget's "version manifest" — one of the 3 files a real
# submission to microsoft/winget-pkgs needs (PackageVersion must match
# the installer/locale manifests below exactly). {{VERSION}} is filled
# in by packaging/winget/generate.sh for a real release; this .tmpl
# file is never used as-is.
#
# Submitting this to microsoft/winget-pkgs (a PR against their public
# repo) is the external, deferred step this ticket's own scope
# decision left for later — see docs/co-308-fleet-rollout.md. This
# file's own shape was NOT validated against winget's live schema or
# `winget validate` (no network access during this ticket's build);
# that's the one real verification gap to close before the first
# actual submission.
PackageIdentifier: Devminified.Carryon
PackageVersion: {{VERSION}}
DefaultLocale: en-US
ManifestType: version
ManifestVersion: 1.6.0
